      "id": "cluster-distribute-visual-weight",
      "name": "Distribute visual weight",
      "color": "amber",
      "fact": "Balance does not require identical halves: symmetry, asymmetry, visual weight, and placement determine whether an arrangement feels stable, tense, centered, or deliberately uneven.",
      "terms": [
        "symmetry",
